Source demo/tapes/common.tape

Output demo/out/filter.gif

Hide
Type "docker run --rm -it ports-demo"
Enter
Wait+Screen@60s /❯/
Sleep 2s
Type "ports"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show

Sleep 1s
Type "/"
Sleep 600ms
Type "3000"
Sleep 2500ms

Backspace 4
Sleep 700ms
Type "redis"
Sleep 2500ms

Backspace 5
Sleep 700ms
Type "node"
Sleep 2500ms

Escape
Sleep 1800ms

Hide
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
Type "exit"
Enter
Sleep 1s
